Plato for Debian
================

This package provides the desktop Linux version of Plato, a document
reader designed for e-ink devices.

XDG Base Directories
--------------------
Plato follows the XDG Base Directory Specification for configuration
and data storage:

  * Configuration: ~/.config/plato/
  * Data files:    ~/.local/share/plato/
  * System assets:  /usr/share/plato/

When running from source (development), Plato uses the current directory
for resources. When installed as a system package, it uses the XDG paths.

Supported Formats
-----------------
  * PDF (via PDFPurr, pure Rust)
  * EPUB
  * CBZ/CBR (comic book archives)
  * DJVU
  * Images (PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP, TGA)

Keyboard Shortcuts
------------------
  * Escape    - Quit / Go back
  * B         - Backward / Previous page
  * F         - Forward / Next page
  * P         - Power button
  * L         - Light (frontlight toggle)
  * H         - Home
  * E         - Erase
  * G         - Highlight
  * [         - Rotate screen left
  * ]         - Rotate screen right
  * S         - Take screenshot
  * I/O       - Zoom in/out (with mouse)

